ery_ack and the runner records the typed stop generically). ToolRun 200bd579c232bffb74b1fab7a320a330: all lint gates pass (ruff, mypy, symvision, keep-sorted), 60204 passed, 18 skipped, 2 pre-existing failures, verdict no_new_failures; follow-up recorded above. Local epic-symbol rows for this phase are gone; origin/master still carries the three old 1.4.1.6-keyed rows until this tree lands, so close must wait for landing (same as phase 1.5). No ancestor beads touched."}}
